</div>

<ul>
<li>Avoid cancelling approved sessions without valid reason.</li>
<li>Keep your availability schedule updated in the system.</li>
<li>Do not share student data or confidential information externally.</li>
<li>Report inappropriate behavior immediately to the admin.</li>
</ul>

<div class="guideline-badge" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">

    <svg width="20" height="20" fill="#16a34a" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M12 3L1 9l11 6 9-4.91V17h2V9L12 3z"/>
        <path d="M11 12.98L3.21 9 11 5.02 18.79 9 11 12.98z"/>
    </svg>

    <span>Faculty Guidelines</span>
</div>

<ul>
<li>Begin the session on time and take attendance.</li>
<li>Briefly recap the previous class before starting new content.</li>
<li>Report any technical or behavioral issues to the admin immediately.</li>
<li>Share study materials or references if necessary.</li>
<li>Review the student’s enquiry details before the session begins.</li>
<li>Ensure a stable internet connection and proper audio/video setup.</li>
</ul>

</div>
</div>
</div>

